# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-06-19 01:12

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:11
translate ptbr carlfriday_4a86c24e:

    # ra "\"Hey, is this useful?\""
    ra "\"Ei, isso é útil?\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:12
translate ptbr carlfriday_0538d73f:

    # "I look over at Raven as he holds up what looks like a porcelain canine doll of some kind."
    "Eu olho pro Raven enquanto ele segura o que parece ser uma boneca canina de porcelana de algum tipo."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:13
translate ptbr carlfriday_6d6aafa2:

    # m "\"Uhh, maybe? Again, just set aside the stuff you think might be interesting enough for me to take pictures of.\""
    m "\"Uhh, talvez? Novamente, só deixa de lado as coisas que cê acha que podem ser interessantes o suficiente pra eu tirar fotos.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:14
translate ptbr carlfriday_e15c847f:

    # ra "\"Okay.\""
    ra "\"Beleza.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:15
translate ptbr carlfriday_860c47ba:

    # "He puts it to the side and starts digging through the tub (rather carelessly) again."
    "Ele coloca a boneca de lado e começa a fuçar na caixa (com bastante descuido) de novo."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:17
translate ptbr carlfriday_8eae20f2:

    # "I sigh and turn back to the binder."
    "Eu suspiro e me viro de volta pro fichário."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:18
translate ptbr carlfriday_223c300b:

    # "I really wish Carl had agreed to come down."
    "Eu realmente queria que o Carl tivesse topado descer."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:19
translate ptbr carlfriday_8dcd72dd:

    # "Again, he declined to help me, even after Raven arrived."
    "Mais uma vez, ele se recusou a me ajudar, mesmo depois que o Raven chegou."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:20
translate ptbr carlfriday_325a2368:

    # "But now I guess I have my answer as to why."
    "Mas agora acho que tenho minha resposta pro porquê."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:21
translate ptbr carlfriday_60a40de1:

    # "More stuff is missing from the tubs...and I know it can't be anyone else except Carl."
    "Tem mais coisas faltando nas caixas... e eu sei que não pode ser mais ninguém além do Carl."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:22
translate ptbr carlfriday_695d6230:

    # "The containers were turned the opposite way when I got down to the crawlspace earlier this morning."
    "Os recipientes tavam virados pro lado oposto quando desci pro espaço apertado mais cedo hoje de manhã."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:23
translate ptbr carlfriday_79875ce3:

    # "On top of that there were two more loose wrappers in the tub, along with..."
    "Além disso, tinha mais duas embalagens soltas na caixa, junto com..."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:24
translate ptbr carlfriday_ef738c9e:

    # "I trace a paw up the torn edges of a missing page in the \"John Begay\" section."
    "Eu passo a pata pelas bordas rasgadas de uma página faltando na seção do \"John Begay\"."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:25
translate ptbr carlfriday_24854c43:

    # "The question, of course, is why he would be doing this."
    "A pergunta, é claro, é o porquê dele estar fazendo isso."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:26
translate ptbr carlfriday_464b2b57:

    # "There's absolutely no reason for it."
    "Não tem absolutamente nenhum motivo pra isso."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:27
translate ptbr carlfriday_89ba12d1:

    # "And the bizarreness of the situation makes it pretty much impossible for me to confront him on it."
    "E a bizarrice da situação torna quase impossível pra mim confrontá-lo sobre isso."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:28
translate ptbr carlfriday_2b75567b:

    # "It's his house, after all, though if he didn't want me going through it why would he have shown it to me in the first place?"
    "Afinal de contas, a casa é dele, mas se ele não queria que eu mexesse nisso, por que ele me mostrou essas coisas pra começar?"

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:29
translate ptbr carlfriday_192c6ef7:

    # "And he isn't even trying to cover his tracks."
    "E ele nem tá tentando cobrir os próprios rastros."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:30
translate ptbr carlfriday_8ceb754d:

    # "In fact, I practically caught him in the act just a few nights ago. He must know now that I'd be able to put that together pretty quick."
    "Na verdade, eu praticamente peguei ele no flagra há umas noites. Ele deve saber agora que eu seria capaz de juntar as peças bem rápido."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:31
translate ptbr carlfriday_a45338ee:

    # "I close the binder, deciding that this will be the last time I'll be going through this stuff."
    "Eu fecho o fichário, decidindo que essa vai ser a última vez que vou fuçar nessas coisas."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:32
translate ptbr carlfriday_3e8a2fcd:

    # "If Carl doesn't want me digging up info on his family's history then I'm not gonna pry any further."
    "Se o Carl não quer que eu desenterre informações sobre a história da família dele, então eu não vou bisbilhotar mais."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:34
translate ptbr carlfriday_dd06bdd2:

    # ra "\"Hey look at this!\""
    ra "\"Ei, olha pra isso!\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:35
translate ptbr carlfriday_c75fc3e2:

    # "Raven holds up a wooden train."
    "O Raven levanta um trem de madeira."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:36
translate ptbr carlfriday_934f47ad:

    # ra "\"Bet this was probably the shit back in the day.\""
    ra "\"Aposto que isso aqui devia ser o máximo antigamente.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:37
translate ptbr carlfriday_3f739ce1:

    # "I sigh."
    "Eu suspiro."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:38
translate ptbr carlfriday_6f3d6939:

    # m "\"Probably.\""
    m "\"Provavelmente.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:41
translate ptbr carlfriday_9d999a96:

    # "My phone buzzes."
    "Meu celular vibra."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:42
translate ptbr carlfriday_aa58cdbd:

    # "I take it out, my notifications telling me I have a text from Leo."
    "Eu pego ele, minhas notificações dizendo que tenho uma mensagem do Leo."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:47
translate ptbr carlfriday_0ae9bcd0:

    # ""
    ""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:48
translate ptbr carlfriday_fb7bfafe:

    # "For a moment I feel a pang of guilt."
    "Por um momento sinto uma pontada de culpa."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:49
translate ptbr carlfriday_ed0fa9af:

    # "He'd told me how excited he was to hang out with me this week, yet I've spent almost all of my time here with Carl."
    "Ele me disse o quão animado tava pra sair comigo essa semana, mas eu passei quase todo o meu tempo aqui com o Carl."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:50
translate ptbr carlfriday_d1e8c6e8:

    # "Though, from what I've gathered in texts, Leo's been spending most of his time with TJ and Jenna since the lynx is apparently still feeling down."
    "Apesar disso, pelo que entendi nas mensagens, o Leo tem passado a maior parte do tempo com o TJ e a Jenna já que o lince aparentemente ainda tá se sentindo pra baixo."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:51
translate ptbr carlfriday_71167723:

    # "At least he had that to keep him occupied."
    "Pelo menos ele tinha isso pra mantê-lo ocupado."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:52
translate ptbr carlfriday_c91fda05:

    # "My excuse that Carl has all the info I need for my project made my decision to spend most of my time here a little less weird."
    "Minha desculpa de que o Carl tem todas as informações que preciso pro meu projeto deixou minha decisão de passar a maior parte do meu tempo aqui um pouco menos estranha."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:58
translate ptbr carlfriday_0ae9bcd0_1:

    # ""
    ""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:60
translate ptbr carlfriday_fe380240:

    # m "\"Hey, Rave? I'm gonna go out to meet with some friends, could you keep Carl company?\""
    m "\"Ei, Rave? Eu vou sair pra encontrar uns amigos, cê pode fazer companhia pro Carl?\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:61
translate ptbr carlfriday_7184e5b0:

    # ra "\"Okay, sure.\""
    ra "\"Beleza, claro.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:62
translate ptbr carlfriday_3f566bc4:

    # "Raven seems busy pushing the train across the ground while attaching more cars."
    "O Raven parece ocupado empurrando o trem no chão enquanto prende mais vagões."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:63
translate ptbr carlfriday_dfc11b89:

    # m "\"And make sure you keep that together; I wanna get a picture of it later."
    m "\"E garanta que isso vai continuar inteiro; eu quero tirar uma foto depois.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:70
translate ptbr carlfriday_0ae9bcd0_2:

    # ""
    ""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:72
translate ptbr carlfriday_ee150d1b:

    # "I sigh and put my phone away, patting my pocket for my keys as I head up the crawlspace steps."
    "Eu suspiro e guardo o celular, batendo no bolso para ver as chaves enquanto subo os degraus do espaço apertado."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:78
translate ptbr carlfriday_ad851a35:

    # "Leo waves at me as I walk into the diner."
    "O Leo acena pra mim enquanto eu entro na lanchonete."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:79
translate ptbr carlfriday_253c052a:

    # "I'm surprised to see that the diner is completely empty."
    "Eu fico surpreso em ver que a lanchonete tá completamente vazia."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:80
translate ptbr carlfriday_e3646c56:

    # "There's almost always SOMEONE in here."
    "Quase sempre tem ALGUÉM aqui."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:81
translate ptbr carlfriday_92c75f53:

    # "Something else is amiss, too, and I don't notice it until I've sat down across from the wolf."
    "Tem mais alguma coisa errada também, e eu não percebo até me sentar de frente pro lobo."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:82
translate ptbr carlfriday_6e136963:

    # "It's eerily quiet."
    "Tá assustadoramente quieto."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:83
translate ptbr carlfriday_d04192e6:

    # "The usual rockabilly tracks aren't playing from the jukebox."
    "As músicas de rockabilly de sempre não tão tocando na jukebox."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:85
translate ptbr carlfriday_6d66040d:

    # l "\"Hey.\""
    l "\"Oi.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:86
translate ptbr carlfriday_d7999a2e:

    # m "\"Hey man. What's up?\""
    m "\"E aí, cara. Que foi?\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:87
translate ptbr carlfriday_eb1c9929:

    # "The atmosphere is unreasonably awkward and I blame most of that on the strange state of the diner."
    "O clima tá desnecessariamente estranho e eu culpo a maior parte disso no estado estranho da lanchonete."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:88
translate ptbr carlfriday_f88bef81:

    # l "\"Um, so apparently we have to go up to the counter to order; Janice isn't here.\""
    l "\"Hum, então parece que a gente tem que ir até o balcão pra pedir; a Janice não tá aqui.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:89
translate ptbr carlfriday_a2165df7:

    # m "\"Oh...why's that?\""
    m "\"Ah... por que isso?\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:90
translate ptbr carlfriday_0431a5cf:

    # "Leo shrugs as he sips on a milkshake."
    "O Leo dá de ombros enquanto toma um gole do milkshake."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:91
translate ptbr carlfriday_2eabbfbd:

    # l "\"Dunno. Sick, I guess.\""
    l "\"Sei lá. Doente, eu acho.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:92
translate ptbr carlfriday_8043b2ec:

    # "It's then that I remember the story Flynn had told us about Janice and her...incident."
    "É então que eu lembro da história que o Flynn nos contou sobre a Janice e o... incidente dela."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:93
translate ptbr carlfriday_306b125e:

    # "Though I'm not gonna bring that up because I'm sure that's what Leo's thinking as well."
    "Embora eu não vá tocar nesse assunto porque tenho certeza de que é isso que o Leo tá pensando também."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:94
translate ptbr carlfriday_1b82eca4:

    # m "\"Well, I'm not really hungry anyway...what was it you wanted to talk about?\""
    m "\"Bom, eu não tô com tanta fome mesmo... sobre o que cê queria falar?\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:96
translate ptbr carlfriday_5935faae:

    # "Leo swallows slowly, then looks down at the table."
    "O Leo engole devagar, depois olha pra mesa."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:97
translate ptbr carlfriday_8b85de68:

    # l "\"So you probably know this whole...thing...didn't go as I'd planned.\""
    l "\"Então cê provavelmente sabe que toda essa... coisa... não saiu como eu tinha planejado.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:98
translate ptbr carlfriday_c412785d:

    # "I look at the collection of condensation on his glass before I speak up."
    "Eu olho para a coleção de condensação no copo dele antes de falar."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:99
translate ptbr carlfriday_86d7488b:

    # m "\"Yeah, sort of.\""
    m "\"É, mais ou menos.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:100
translate ptbr carlfriday_099569b4:

    # "Leo frowns, as if he'd hoped I would have tried to deny it."
    "O Leo franze a testa, como se ele esperasse que eu tivesse tentado negar."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:101
translate ptbr carlfriday_5eaf001d:

    # l "\"Well, it's mostly my fault. I should have done a better job at resolving shit.\""
    l "\"Bom, a culpa é maior parte minha. Eu devia ter feito um trabalho melhor pra resolver essa porra toda.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:102
translate ptbr carlfriday_cad86da1:

    # "Now I frown."
    "Agora eu franzo a testa."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:103
translate ptbr carlfriday_cd3315d1:

    # m "\"Hey...\""
    m "\"Ei...\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:105
translate ptbr carlfriday_31a2c010:

    # "I wait until he takes his eyes off the table to look at me."
    "Eu espero até que ele tire os olhos da mesa pra olhar pra mim."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:106
translate ptbr carlfriday_e1970c9b:

    # m "\"You know...you're not our big brother anymore.\""
    m "\"Sabe... cê não é mais nosso irmão mais velho.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:108
translate ptbr carlfriday_25ac1fbf:

    # "He looks back down at the table."
    "Ele olha de volta pra mesa."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:109
translate ptbr carlfriday_f3a2605b:

    # m "\"We're adults, believe it or not. We make our own decisions now.\""
    m "\"Nós somos adultos, acredite ou não. Nós tomamos nossas próprias decisões agora.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:110
translate ptbr carlfriday_79b242df:

    # m "\"Everything we're doing right now is our decision, our fault, not yours.\""
    m "\"Tudo o que estamos fazendo agora é decisão nossa, culpa nossa, não sua.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:112
translate ptbr carlfriday_ff4de210:

    # "Leo's eyes get shiny, but he smiles."
    "Os olhos do Leo ficam brilhantes, mas ele sorri."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:113
translate ptbr carlfriday_e7fc2420:

    # l "\"Heh, yeah, you're right. Guess I just want to go back, is all.\""
    l "\"Heh, sim, cê tá certo. Acho que eu só quero voltar no tempo, só isso.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:114
translate ptbr carlfriday_3fca7940:

    # m "\"Hey, we're still young. You're talking like my grandpa.\""
    m "\"Ei, ainda somos jovens. Cê tá falando igual meu avô.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:115
translate ptbr carlfriday_c475785a:

    # "Leo laughs and leans back."
    "O Leo ri e se recosta."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:116
translate ptbr carlfriday_c516df13:

    # l "\"Mine, too.\""
    l "\"O meu também.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:118
translate ptbr carlfriday_99305e3e:

    # "Leo jerks his head, as if he just remembered something."
    "O Leo sacode a cabeça, como se tivesse acabado de se lembrar de algo."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:119
translate ptbr carlfriday_67e03e8e:

    # l "\"So what the hell happened between Jenna and Carl?\""
    l "\"Então o que diabos aconteceu entre a Jenna e o Carl?\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:120
translate ptbr carlfriday_11de2cfb:

    # m "\"I was actually hoping YOU could have told me that. I have no idea.\""
    m "\"Na verdade, eu tava esperando que VOCÊ pudesse me dizer isso. Eu não faço ideia.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:121
translate ptbr carlfriday_c493bf48:

    # l "\"She keeps going on about him not participating. I told her it was fine, but she can't seem to let it go.\""
    l "\"Ela não para de falar sobre ele não estar participando. Eu disse a ela que tava tudo bem, mas ela parece não conseguir deixar pra lá.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:122
translate ptbr carlfriday_02822405:

    # m "\"Yeah...well, it's really weighing on Carl, I think.\""
    m "\"É... bem, isso tá realmente pesando pro Carl, eu acho.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:123
translate ptbr carlfriday_6a2f1bd2:

    # "Leo swigs his milkshake, forgoing the straw."
    "O Leo toma um gole do milkshake, deixando o canudo de lado."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:125
translate ptbr carlfriday_c001200c:

    # "He wipes away the cream from his muzzle as he brings it back down onto the table with some resolve."
    "Ele limpa o creme do focinho enquanto o traz de volta à mesa com alguma determinação."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:127
translate ptbr carlfriday_586671fc:

    # l "\"Well, I'm not letting it end like this.\""
    l "\"Bom, eu não vou deixar que acabe assim.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:128
translate ptbr carlfriday_3171f423:

    # m "\"Hmm? Let what end like this?\""
    m "\"Hmm? Deixar o que acabar assim?\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:130
translate ptbr carlfriday_ee8ef359:

    # l "\"Our group.\""
    l "\"O nosso grupo.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:131
translate ptbr carlfriday_b65ba8d6:

    # l "\"You realize this might be the last time we're all together?\""
    l "\"Cê percebe que essa pode ser a última vez que tamos todos juntos?\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:132
translate ptbr carlfriday_3bd90c71:

    # "That sentence immediately forms a lump in my throat."
    "Essa frase imediatamente forma um nó na minha garganta."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:133
translate ptbr carlfriday_bf023949:

    # m "\"Yeah...\""
    m "\"É...\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:134
translate ptbr carlfriday_d9d80346:

    # l "\"So I'm not gonna let it end like this; Flynn pissed at TJ, Jenna pissed at Carl, you and me...\""
    l "\"Então eu não vou deixar que acabe assim; O Flynn puto com o TJ, a Jenna puta com o Carl, eu e cê...\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:135
translate ptbr carlfriday_d31af9e1:

    # "He lets that hang and, when I don't say anything he coughs."
    "Ele deixa isso no ar e, quando eu não digo nada, ele tosse."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:137
translate ptbr carlfriday_d7335b27:

    # l "\"So I planned something.\""
    l "\"Então eu planejei uma coisa.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:138
translate ptbr carlfriday_df8ec4bc:

    # m "\"What?\""
    m "\"O que?\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:139
translate ptbr carlfriday_efe8ae17:

    # "His hesitant tone is making me nervous."
    "O tom hesitante dele tá me deixando nervoso."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:141
translate ptbr carlfriday_5101f6af:

    # "He looks me in the eye and squares his shoulders."
    "Ele me olha nos olhos e endireita os ombros."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:142
translate ptbr carlfriday_6b574060:

    # l "\"We're going to the lake tomorrow.\""
    l "\"Nós vamos pro lago amanhã.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:143
translate ptbr carlfriday_6885ec6f:

    # "He lets that sink in as I turn his words over in my head."
    "Ele deixa isso afundar enquanto eu viro as palavras dele na minha cabeça."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:144
translate ptbr carlfriday_8ed98d3f:

    # "I had suspected that this is what he was getting at."
    "Eu já suspeitava que era onde ele queria chegar."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:145
translate ptbr carlfriday_41b6f603:

    # "I consider my words for a moment, not wanting to say the wrong thing."
    "Eu considero minhas palavras por um momento, não querendo dizer a coisa errada."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:146
translate ptbr carlfriday_4e8a4ec3:

    # m "\"I...I don't know if that's—\""
    m "\"Eu... eu não sei se isso é—\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:148
translate ptbr carlfriday_baf5e097:

    # "Leo puts up a paw."
    "O Leo levanta uma pata."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:149
translate ptbr carlfriday_2b871014:

    # l "\"I've thought this over real hard, Chase.\""
    l "\"Eu pensei muito bem nisso, Chase.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:150
translate ptbr carlfriday_d6216d80:

    # l "\"That day, what happened to Sydney, it fucked us all up. Changed us all.\""
    l "\"Aquele dia, o que aconteceu com a Sydney, fodeu com todos nós. Mudou todos nós.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:151
translate ptbr carlfriday_bf3b2474:

    # l "\"Not for the better, either. It took something from us.\""
    l "\"E também não foi pra melhor. Tirou algo da gente.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:152
translate ptbr carlfriday_0da9639c:

    # "Leo pauses, looking to the side as if searching for words."
    "O Leo faz uma pausa, olhando pro lado como se procurasse por palavras."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:153
translate ptbr carlfriday_19f8c4af:

    # l "\"Flynn, Sydney was his best friend.\""
    l "\"O Flynn, a Sydney era a melhor amiga dele.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:154
translate ptbr carlfriday_d290698b:

    # l "\"And Carl, he's been depressed ever since.\""
    l "\"E o Carl, ele tem ficado deprimido desde então.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:155
translate ptbr carlfriday_0b2b6eb6:

    # "I feel the need to speak up."
    "Eu sinto a necessidade de falar."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:156
translate ptbr carlfriday_ab3b947c:

    # m "\"I don't know if you can pin all of that on what happened. Maybe we would have turned out the same—\""
    m "\"Eu não sei se dá pra culpar tudo isso pelo que aconteceu. Talvez a gente tivesse acabado do mesmo jeito—\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:157
translate ptbr carlfriday_8c80538d:

    # "He presses on."
    "Ele insiste."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:158
translate ptbr carlfriday_ef476ce7:

    # l "\"TJ, he saw Sydney die, saw him drown. Can you imagine that at eight years old?\""
    l "\"O TJ, ele viu a Sydney morrer, viu ela se afogar. Cê consegue imaginar isso aos oito anos de idade?\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:159
translate ptbr carlfriday_8fb74f12:

    # l "\"And Jenna, has she ever been happy since?\""
    l "\"E a Jenna, ela já foi feliz desde então?\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:160
translate ptbr carlfriday_6a20a80d:

    # "I shake my head."
    "Eu balanço a cabeça negativamente."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:161
translate ptbr carlfriday_bb22b182:

    # m "\"I always felt like that experience helped her, in a weird way. She decided to go to school, leave Echo.\""
    m "\"Eu sempre senti que aquela experiência ajudou ela, de um jeito estranho. Ela decidiu ir pra faculdade, sair de Echo.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:162
translate ptbr carlfriday_a0cd808b:

    # "He doesn't seem to be listening to me."
    "Ele parece não estar me ouvindo."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:163
translate ptbr carlfriday_664e0270:

    # l "\"And you...I love you, but you did change the day it happened. You're practically a different person.\""
    l "\"E você... eu te amo, mas você mudou no dia em que aconteceu. Cê é praticamente uma pessoa diferente.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:164
translate ptbr carlfriday_1d9c4967:

    # "I don't have anything to say to that..."
    "Eu não tenho nada a dizer sobre isso..."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:166
translate ptbr carlfriday_60324005:

    # l "\"And me...I—\""
    l "\"E eu... eu—\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:167
translate ptbr carlfriday_42211834:

    # "His voice catches in his throat and I close my eyes."
    "A voz dele trava na garganta e eu fecho os olhos."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:168
translate ptbr carlfriday_a3d6b6bd:

    # m "\"Leo...\""
    m "\"Leo...\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:169
translate ptbr carlfriday_4ea64999:

    # l "\"I—I was supposed to be watching all of you. I was supposed to take care of—\""
    l "\"Eu—eu devia tá de olho em todos vocês. Eu devia cuidar da—\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:170
translate ptbr carlfriday_0a4e66a5:

    # "Leo stops talking and I keep my eyes on the table while he grabs one of the brown napkins and wipes his eyes."
    "O Leo para de falar e eu mantenho os olhos na mesa enquanto ele pega um dos guardanapos marrons e limpa os olhos."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:171
translate ptbr carlfriday_249b2d85:

    # "When he speaks again his voice is thick and cracks with emotion."
    "Quando ele fala de novo, a voz dele tá embargada e falha de emoção."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:172
translate ptbr carlfriday_03cddafb:

    # l "\"His parents never said but...they trusted me with Sydney, and I think they blamed me—\""
    l "\"Os pais dela nunca disseram, mas... eles confiaram a Sydney a mim, e eu acho que eles me culparam—\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:173
translate ptbr carlfriday_3e554bb5:

    # m "\"No, Leo.\""
    m "\"Não, Leo.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:174
translate ptbr carlfriday_c5f7cf07:

    # "He falls silent."
    "Ele fica em silêncio."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:175
translate ptbr carlfriday_22b545ab:

    # "For a while we both sit there and share the feeling of being weighed down by eleven years of baggage."
    "Por um tempo, nós dois ficamos sentados lá e compartilhamos a sensação de estarmos sobrecarregados por onze anos de bagagem."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:176
translate ptbr carlfriday_2fcb9e4a:

    # "A good five minutes goes by, Leo staring out the window."
    "Uns bons cinco minutos se passam, o Leo olhando pela janela."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:177
translate ptbr carlfriday_0e82831b:

    # "The afternoon sun turns his normally red fur almost orange."
    "O sol da tarde deixa o pelo normalmente vermelho dele quase laranja."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:178
translate ptbr carlfriday_c5af2870:

    # l "\"We can't do this anymore...and this might be our last chance to find some kind of closure.\""
    l "\"A gente não pode mais fazer isso... e essa pode ser a nossa última chance de encontrar algum tipo de encerramento.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:179
translate ptbr carlfriday_53c6a4a0:

    # "I take a deep breath, swallowing past the lump."
    "Eu respiro fundo, engolindo o nó na garganta."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:180
translate ptbr carlfriday_1f228d29:

    # m "\"Okay.\""
    m "\"Beleza.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:182
translate ptbr carlfriday_5a9d0dde:

    # "He looks up at me, relief all over his face."
    "Ele olha pra mim, alívio por todo o rosto."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:183
translate ptbr carlfriday_74886272:

    # l "\"So you'll go?\""
    l "\"Então cê vai?\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:184
translate ptbr carlfriday_ea3645a4:

    # "I smile reassuringly at him."
    "Eu sorrio de forma tranquilizadora pra ele."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:185
translate ptbr carlfriday_48c92685:

    # m "\"Of course. Have you told anyone else?\""
    m "\"Claro. Cê já falou pra mais alguém?\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:187
translate ptbr carlfriday_08879a59:

    # "He lowers his ears."
    "Ele abaixa as orelhas."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:188
translate ptbr carlfriday_3c2bad17:

    # l "\"No...\""
    l "\"Não...\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:189
translate ptbr carlfriday_8640f0ae:

    # m "\"Oh, God...Are you going to tell them?\""
    m "\"Aí meu Deus... Cê vai contar pra eles?\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:190
translate ptbr carlfriday_700cbf71:

    # l "\"I dunno...\""
    l "\"Sei não...\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:191
translate ptbr carlfriday_a540e63f:

    # m "\"Leo.\""
    m "\"Leo.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:192
translate ptbr carlfriday_e93e45d4:

    # "He does his signature shrug, paws out."
    "Ele dá seu encolher de ombros característico, com as patas pra fora."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:193
translate ptbr carlfriday_21707925:

    # l "\"I really don't know how else to get them to go.\""
    l "\"Eu realmente não sei que outro jeito tem pra fazer eles irem.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:194
translate ptbr carlfriday_26b3a0c4:

    # m "\"Then there's no way this isn't gonna be a disaster.\""
    m "\"Então não tem como isso não ser um desastre.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:195
translate ptbr carlfriday_2e10554c:

    # l "\"Hey, we gotta try.\""
    l "\"Ei, a gente tem que tentar.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:197
translate ptbr carlfriday_7d02e8ce:

    # m "\"I guess...\""
    m "\"Eu acho...\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:198
translate ptbr carlfriday_309c9574:

    # l "\"So can you bring Carl with you?\""
    l "\"Então cê pode trazer o Carl com você?\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:199
translate ptbr carlfriday_a3506f66:

    # "I think for a moment."
    "Eu penso por um momento."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:200
translate ptbr carlfriday_31027c53:

    # m "\"Oh shit, Carl has an interview.\""
    m "\"Ah merda, o Carl tem uma entrevista.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:201
translate ptbr carlfriday_4ee3899b:

    # l "\"What time?\""
    l "\"Que horas?\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:202
translate ptbr carlfriday_2f15ea91:

    # m "\"Uh, 10, I think.\""
    m "\"Hã, às 10, eu acho.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:204
translate ptbr carlfriday_acc89b9b:

    # l "\"Well, we'll plan around it. Text me the actual time, okay?\""
    l "\"Bom, a gente se planeja ao redor disso. Me manda a hora certa por mensagem, beleza?\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:207
translate ptbr carlfriday_bed8585f:

    # l "\"Anyway, I invited you out here to talk about more than shitty stuff.\""
    l "\"Enfim, eu te chamei aqui pra falar de mais coisas do que só merda.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:209
translate ptbr carlfriday_543a8713:

    # l "\"What have you been up to the past three years?\""
    l "\"O que cê tem feito nesses últimos três anos?\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:210
translate ptbr carlfriday_c68b00c1:

    # "And so we talk for the next two hours, catching up on everything."
    "E então nós conversamos pelas próximas duas horas, botando o papo em dia sobre tudo."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:211
translate ptbr carlfriday_4055115e:

    # "It feels good and I regret not spending more time with Leo this past week."
    "É uma sensação boa e eu me arrependo de não ter passado mais tempo com o Leo nessa última semana."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:215
translate ptbr carlfriday_d3fba017:

    # "As we part in the small parking lot, Leo surprises me with a hug."
    "Ao nos despedirmos no pequeno estacionamento, o Leo me surpreende com um abraço."

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:216
translate ptbr carlfriday_31cb6c23:

    # l "\"I have a good feeling about this. It'll be hard, but we'll be better for it.\""
    l "\"Eu tô com um bom pressentimento sobre isso. Vai ser difícil, mas nós vamos ficar melhor por isso.\""

# game/Carl-Friday.rpy:217
translate ptbr carlfriday_46494559:

    # "I hug back, hoping with all my heart that he's right."
    "Eu retribuo o abraço, torcendo com todo o meu coração para que ele esteja certo."

